<title>FRANCE: Trichet confirms goal of Franc stability in ERM.</title>
<headline>Trichet confirms goal of Franc stability in ERM.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of France governor Jean-Claude Trichet on Tuesday confirmed policy of franc stability versus the other most credible currencies in the European exchange rate mechanism.</p>
<p>&quot;As it has been for 10 years, the stability of the franc will be maintained against the group of the most credible currencies in the European exchange rate mechanism,&quot; Trichet said at a news conference.</p>
</text>
